# (main today: 513 examples, 24 rules, 32 checks. The 24 extra examples are the
# new .claude/guard/ paths added to guard-self-protect; the rule count is
# unchanged, and no rule was removed or weakened.)
#
# If the hunks have drifted because main moved on, use:
#
#     git apply --3way docs/proposals/guard-into-claude.patch
#
# Then RESTART the assistant session (settings and hooks are read at start-up)
# and run the arming probe on BOTH shell tools. See
